# The spirit in the haystack (map 0 sub-area 1), from the user's quick save (out/bugsaves/compass-spirit,
# not committed; copy it first). Title (Start), then the quick load at VI 100; stick right walks into the
# haystack until the spirit is in front (VI 138), A takes it, C-up puts the free level into the first element.
#   ELTALE_DATA_DIR=<copy> ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT=100 ELTALE_SPIRIT_LOG=1 eltale-p1 --headless --fast --frames 140
#       --input tests/spirit-haystack.input --rom ...
# prints P1_SPIRIT front=1, found flag=1, levels 1 1 1 1 -> 2 1 1 1 (docs/P1_OS_STATUS.md)
5 0x1000 0 0
7 0 0 0
120 0 80 0
137 0 0 0
150 0x8000 0 0
152 0 0 0
190 0x0008 0 0
192 0 0 0
